\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/epdCr92klVDihlbrc42avOI8vFb.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-04-23\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 6\",\"overview\":\"With the help of bag maker Neil Wragg and print artist Daniel Heath, Sarah Moore breathes new life into a leaking tent, a scandi-style coffee table and a miniature greenhouse.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ecEKgMYmx5AaAxIEbt4Yxeca4Fm.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-04-26\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Episode 7\",\"overview\":\"Jacqui Joseph teams up with designer Rupert Blanchard and furniture artist Chloe Kempster to spruce up a travel trunk, a 1940s utility cabinet and a dressing table.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yRIV88wiRzr9owyRwkY3xnCKQ6O.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-04-27\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Episode 8\",\"overview\":\"Sarah Moore enlists upcycling expert Sarah Peterson and lighting expert Guy Trench to repurpose dining furniture, some vintage lawn games and some aluminium lampshades.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x0kg3t2bfD46OkKovTAZaxQ25KC.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-04-28\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Episode 9\",\"overview\":\"Sarah Moore, upholsterer Simion Hawtin-Smith and print artist Zoe Murphy breathe new life into a retro swivel chair, a large oak dining table and a once-cherished sideboard.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yE0ly9VAuZeEUAdGofHwLYABnqJ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-04-29\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Episode 10\",\"overview\":\"Jacqui Joseph teams up with upholsterer Lucianne Hinch and woodwork wizard Bruce Faulseit to transform a half-moon bamboo chair, a pine corner unit and a mid-century bedside table.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qCm9dyQGjOiON7f7yFIoc5sEfq2.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\